update_rule.pseudocode:
if t == 0:
  G = WattsStrogatz(N=population_size, k=average_degree, p=network_rewiring_prob)
  assign network_neighbors to each Person from G
for each person:
  sample movement schedule by time shares (home, work_school, retail, public_transport)
  for each non-home context:
    choose a Location of that type in person's region uniformly (or weighted by capacity)
    add to daily_location_assignments[person]
ensure capacity constraints by iterative reassignment or random thinning if assigned > capacity
